        "type": "browser",
        "status": "paused",
        "message": "`MOB.392` Add a job note to the fixture work order.\n- Only Instructions (`desc`) is filled. `name` and `noteType` are required by the\n  WorkStageJobNote schema but Notes.tsx prefills them through defaultValues, so the\n  form arrives already valid for those two.\n- MUTATES: adds a permanent note to EYRpYJ9QYdQ1JFF10JtB0Q on every run.",
        "tags": [
            "Mobile",
            "env:dev",
            "Work Order",
            "CRUD",
            "Notes"
        ],
        "locations": [
            "gcp:us-west2"
        ],
        "config": {
            "assertions": [],
            "config_variables": [
                {
                    "id": "fe7958bf-435f-4932-af8e-0931caab79e7",
                    "name": "MOBDEV",
                    "type": "global"
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "headers": {},
                "method": "GET",
                "url": "{{ MOBDEV }}"
            },
            "variables": [
